# Line endings matter more than usual in this repository.
#
# Default: normalise to LF in the repo and on checkout, so the corpus hashes
# identically on Windows, macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Exceptions — never touch these.
#
# The ledgers are hash-chained, and every checkpoint stores a *byte offset*
# into them. Converting LF to CRLF on checkout would shift every offset by one
# byte per preceding line, so `verify_chain` and the resume rollback would fail
# against the committed artifacts. Leave them exactly as written.
*.jsonl                 -text
submission_artifacts/** -text

# Token arrays are binary.
*.bin                   -text binary
*.pt                    -text binary
